message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LID model selection framework"
abstract: >-
  An interactive framework that recommends a language identification model for
  an unlabelled short-text corpus, by profiling its linguistic characteristics
  and retrieving the most similar corpora from a knowledge base of benchmarked
  candidate models.
